a05f1e86f`) changes `requirements.txt` from `fastjson==2.8.0` to `fastjson==2.9.4` and adds a security entry to `CHANGELOG.md`.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** #101 \u2014 https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI didn't merge the PR, since policy requires a code owner to approve merges into main.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the advisory and the repository layout.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012BhkiLZKRwZ99ULNRJgCnW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "CVE-2026-31337", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011FsrzrqUzLK2MyrqgKxisS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MMJLzG6weEpjWJKDXFeqCp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "requirements.txt", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012tBPvh559nFpTTeiJaD44p", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "CHANGELOG.md", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The fix is in 2.9.4 (same major line, so this is the smallest change). I'll create a branch.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015NF4a6T5ch2ycE2garcrG9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fastjson-cve-2026-31337", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GKzyexiF4jyztE25a2WoBp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fastjson-cve-2026-31337", "messag